    Effect Monsters, except from the hand. When a monster effect is activated, except
    in the hand (Quick Effect): You can return 1 other Thunder monster you control
    to the hand; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that monster. You
    can only use each effect of "Whisker Blitzclique" once per turn.'
